            "text": "You are a **canine**—specifically, a **domestic dog** (*Canis lupus familiaris*)! \n\nMore broadly, here is what kind of mammal you are:\n\n* **Placental mammal:** Like humans, whales, and bears, dogs give birth to live, developed young nourished via a placenta.\n* **Carnivoran (Order *Carnivora*):** You belong to the group of mammals historically adapted for predation and eating meat, though domestic dogs are technically omnivorous.\n* **Canid (Family *Canidae*):** You are part of the dog family, which includes wolves, jackals, foxes, and dingoes.\n* **Spitz type:** Within the dog world, Pomeranians descend from Arctic sled-dog breeds (the Spitz family), which is why you have that thick double coat and pointed ears, just shrunk down into a tiny \"toy\" size!",
